      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-22T18:11:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, currently we have GPIO, VW and OTHER, maybe we can include an ADC-CMP type to capture the signals that involve voltage monitoring, that way we could avoid having to override this function.",
